ref=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-05T16:07:47-07:00","id":1447653,"title":"","content":"Forget what I said the vampire project they\u2019re filming here in Savannah is a completely different IP","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":".  Found out I was wrong, sadly 05-05-2021, 07:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-12T09:11:12-07:00","id":1448326,"title":"","content":"John Wick's cool and all but the Ideal WoD series has to follow The Big Lebowski. <br /> Three good friends, one a liberal slob (The Dude, A Malkavian. Wait, maybe he's human? ), one an uptight conservative nutcase (A brujah), and the last a weakling that wants everyone to get along (A Caitiff) . They enjoy bowling together. Everything's fine until a case of mistaken identity gets the dude attacked and thus sets him to seek compensation from an uptight millionaire (ventrue) that caused this misunderstanding. Stuff, Stuff, Crazy Toreador woman, a Settite who deals in porn... Oh, and the Germans (Sabbat)... <br /> <br /> Everything about the BL nails &quot;WoD&quot; from the script to the cinematography to the scathing subtext. Only thing that doesn't work for vampires is how... ugly the main characters are (But that works well for mortals) <br /> <br /> That or you imitate Kubrick. Or Tarrantino.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-12T20:03:39-07:00","id":1448380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1446124-remember-when-they-said-there-is-gonna-be-a-tv-show?p=1446185#post1446185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I feel like talking about the dangers of inclusivity diluting a product fundamentally misunderstands the appeal of <i>Vampire: The Masquerade</i> in the first place.<br /> <br /> I also note that people thought Captain Marvel would bomb because of it and it made billions, which people on some forums I frequent denied because it utterly refuted their view that broad based multicutural and inclusive writing were not actually extremely lucractive.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;go woke go broke&amp;quot; is also a disguise usually for much nastier motivations.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> And the Expanse and WItcher are both fantastic programs that are critically acclaimed as well as genre darlings. I think <i>Vampire: The Masquerade</i> will be fine.</div> </div> </div> </div>If Captain Marvel succedded it's only because it was an MCU film.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-12T20:09:02-07:00","id":1448381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1446124-remember-when-they-said-there-is-gonna-be-a-tv-show?p=1446196#post1446196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My issue with Mulan live action isn't the inclusivity. It's the fact it was filmed in lands seized from the local ethnic population currently stuffed into internment camps.<br /> <br /> I'd argue that the portrayal of the Huns as said ethnic people was also wildly disgustingly racist.</div> </div> </div> </div>That movie was obviously made to pander to the citizens of the PRC.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-12T20:17:03-07:00","id":1448382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1446124-remember-when-they-said-there-is-gonna-be-a-tv-show?p=1446235#post1446235\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019d bet on it being set in LA for two main reasons: <br /> <br /> A) Hollywood is in LA, and that is where the writers, actors and studios are probably at.<br /> B) LA By Night, the webcast, may well have been suggested as a reason to why the show could work for a given audience.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let's not forget that eveyone's played bloodlines which is set in LA and they want to see all the familiar faces and locals, I understand that's partially the appeal of the LA actual play but I never got into it. Which is a shame cause Nines is supposed to be in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-12T20:24:11-07:00","id":1448383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1446124-remember-when-they-said-there-is-gonna-be-a-tv-show?p=1446312#post1446312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think &amp;quot;woke&amp;quot; as a perjorative is a weird idea too since it was a term by the black community to mean members that have become aware of systemic racism and abuses. It's since been co-opted as a slur by the Alt-Right.<br /> <br /> Which is ironic because Korra is like 4 seasons of Korra becoming aware of systemic bias against Benders, peasants vs. the Monarchy, and the evils Ethno-Nationalism.<br /> <br /> (Season 2 is her fighting the Devil so that doesn't count)</div> </div> </div> </div>Odd. I seem to recall the term &quot;Woke&quot; coming out of the flat earth community i.e. &quot;I've awakened to the reality that the earth is flat, I am woke&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-12T20:52:07-07:00","id":1448386,"title":"","content":"I have an idea about what direction I want this multi media project to go.<br /> <br /> Fuck movies, TV shows are better.<br /> Stick to animation as it lets you get away with the crazy shit like the massive Nosforatu Caverns or the Tzimitzi flesh haven or the Vohzd or....well anything from werewolf and mage. Bonus points if it's rotoscoped ala &quot;Undone&quot; (I dig that fucking show).<br /> If you want to go the extra mile tie the show with the games that are coming out soon or the V5 meta plot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-13T01:04:37-07:00","id":1448398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AscentionTheMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1446124-remember-when-they-said-there-is-gonna-be-a-tv-show?p=1448380#post1448380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If Captain Marvel succedded it's only because it was an MCU film.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kind of a bizarre statement given it IS an MCU film and one of the highest grossing of them.<br /> <br /> Also, there's no &quot;if&quot;<br /> <br /> It's like saying, &quot;Spider-Man only succeeded because of the fact he has a pre-existing fanbase.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AscentionTheMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1446124-remember-when-they-said-there-is-gonna-be-a-tv-show?p=1448383#post1448383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Odd. I seem to recall the term &quot;Woke&quot; coming out of the flat earth community i.e. &quot;I've awakened to the reality that the earth is flat, I am woke&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woke\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Marcia_Fudge_with_Stay_Woke_Vote_t-shirt_in_2018.jpg/1280px-Marcia_Fudge_with_Stay_Woke_Vote_t-shirt_in_2018.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woke\" target=\"_blank\"> Woke - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woke\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woke </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-14T08:20:34-07:00","id":1448509,"title":"","content":"I hope the WoD shows takes after things like <i>Blake's Seven</i> (in terms of ending), the <i>Handmaid's Tale</i>, the film <i>The Road</i> (barring the upbeat ending), <i>Game of Thrones</i> (before it turned stupid), <i>Black Mirror</i>, the <i>Affair</i>, the <i>Shadowline</i>, and MLP <i>Friendship Is Magic</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-14T10:27:56-07:00","id":1448523,"title":"","content":"I will fully admit to not having read this thread, but I just wanted to plug our latest podcast episode, where we talk about this:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/world-of-darkness-is-coming-to-the-screen\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/609d301ede8bc74727f995ef/1620914208343/Side+Quests+small.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/world-of-darkness-is-coming-to-the-screen\" target=\"_blank\"> World of Darkness is coming to the screen </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/world-of-darkness-is-coming-to-the-screen\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/world-of-darkness-is-coming-to-the-screen </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> It has been announced that the World of Darkness is coming to the screen. So, we go into the information revealed so far and give our takes on it. Remember, we have a Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/WoDarkAges </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-14T13:41:38-07:00","id":1448533,"title":"","content":"I would like an animated series on Netflix like the Castlevania one preferably with less of a edgy atheist written the scripts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-14T21:37:07-07:00","id":1448568,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1446124-remember-when-they-said-there-is-gonna-be-a-tv-show?p=1448533#post1448533\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would like an animated series on Netflix like the Castlevania one preferably with less of a edgy atheist written the scripts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting. Why animation? I like the medium (it's not a genre) and think it can handle a lot of stories. But nothing in the WoD feels like it needs animation, at least not to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-15T05:49:18-07:00","id":1448579,"title":"","content":"For a Changling and Werewolf show. I have a flashback to supposed supernatural shows that have long stretches of nothing magic happening and boring love triangle drama because you don't have the fucking budget for superpowers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-29T22:41:59-07:00","id":1549641,"title":"","content":"It's been years since I last reolied here and in retrospect my idea was shit. I still think a Sequal to penny Deadfull would be Kino but it would work better as a novel then a Animated series or, God forbid, a live action series. Also having one of the kids turn into a Garou and the other into a Mage would vause me to lose my suspension of disbelief so instead of turning into splats they learn linear magic, except one becomes an Extrodinary citizen and the other becomes a traditional Sorcerer, if nothing else that can be a source of conflict in the story and I think we all know that a Story needs conflict.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-30T12:40:56-07:00","id":1549647,"title":"","content":"That doesn't do shit to my suspension of disbelief compared to Garou-Bastet created by Progenitors. Or some Stolen Moon getting everyone's powers. If they're just ordinary examples of their respective games' characters, all is well.<br /> <br /> Maybe not well. Probably filled with a lot of toxic drama. But it's not going to make me cringe from a Garou and Mage being family alone, since the books have noted that it happens often enough to be a thing that comes up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-03T20:47:19-07:00","id":1549802,"title":"","content":"I've been away from the forums for quite some months, I guess. Anything came up from the multimedia front?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-03T22:03:45-07:00","id":1549803,"title":"","content":"Not that I could see. Rather a bit cursory of search on the internet, to be sure, but if there were actually anything moving, someone would have announced something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}